  "description": "You know the drill: A miserable woman is offered a do-over and finds herself magically back in time. However, for Titiana, her second life isn't a hit, either... After ending up a widow in her first life and a divorcée in her second, she's rather doubtful of the mysterious mage who reversed the clock for her, but he convinces her to give it one more shot. This time, determined to stand on her own two feet, she'll open a flower shop and stick to her plan! Can Titiana break her streak of bad luck?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
